    "pr_title": "feat: Allow for zero-width fixed size lists",
    "pr_body": "This PR properly implements `polars.Array(..., 0)`. This does make a few\r\nfundamental changes to how `FixedSizeListArray` works internally. Mainly, it\r\nnow keeps a `length` field that actually determines the length instead of\r\nrelying on the `values.len() / size`.\r\n\r\nFixes #18921, #16878.",
    "pr_comments": [
        "Hi, just FYI you need to repeat the \"Fixes\" for each issue number to automatically close multiple issues. Currently #16878 is not closed ;)"
    ],
